    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "The team is a bit worried about the transition, though. They're asking if there's any specific reason why you're so insistent on those wider safety margins for the lithography tools. Are you just being overly cautious, or is there an actual technical risk we should be looking at before we wipe the current parameters? I'd rather address it now than have the new engine fail on day one.",
